{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_16598","headline":"平陵寓居再逢寒食 · 朱湾","name":"平陵寓居再逢寒食","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"几回江上泣途穷，每遇良辰叹转蓬。\n火燧知从新节变，灰心还与故人同。\n莫听黄鸟愁啼处，自有花开久客中。\n贫病固应无挠事，但将怀抱醉春风。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"朱湾","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_16598.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_16598","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}